  "data":{"canonical_id":"arXiv:2503.18292","arxiv_id":"2503.18292","doi":"10.48550/arXiv.2503.18292","openreview_id":null,"arxiv_categories":{"primary":"cs.DC","cross_list":[]},"title":"Jenga: Effective Memory Management for Serving LLM with Heterogeneity","summary":"Jengaは、modern LLMで層ごとにKV/embeddingサイズやtoken依存範囲が異なるため、PagedAttentionの一律page size・一律prefix cache evictionが内部断片化と低いcache hitを招く問題を扱う。全layer typeのembedding sizeの最小公倍数をcompatibility pageとする二段階allocatorと、layer別のsmall-page allocator/evictor、layer間でeviction集合を整合するprefix-subset evictorをvLLM上へ実装する。H100/L4、多様なhybrid-attention/VLM/speculative-decoding設定で、GPU memory利用を最大79.6%改善し、throughputをH100で最大4.92倍・平均1.80倍改善する。","list_summary":"層ごとに異なる埋め込み幅と保持範囲を、最小公倍数に基づく二段階ページ割当と層別キャッシュ破棄で統一管理する。値そのものを圧縮せずメモリ断片化と不要保持を減らし、vLLM比で処理量を最大4.92倍へ高める。","authors":["Chen Zhang","Kuntai Du","Shu Liu","Woosuk Kwon","Xiangxi Mo","Yufeng Wang","Xiaoxuan Liu","Kaichao You","Zhuohan Li","Mingsheng Long","Jidong Zhai","Joseph Gonzalez","Ion Stoica"],"authors_affiliations":"Tsinghua University、University of Chicago、UC Berkeley、Independent Researcher。","published":"2025-03-24","publication":"arXiv:2503.18292v1","publication_type":"プレプリント","publication_status":"arXiv v1。","lineage":"kv-cache-optimization-compression","topics":["KVキャッシュ","PagedAttention","異種attention","メモリ断片化","prefix caching","VLM"],"importance":"高。PagedAttentionの均一page仮定をheterogeneous layerへ一般化し、allocationとcache policyの両方を層別化する。","hardware_evaluation":"NVIDIA H100 80GBおよびL4 24GB実機。","hardware_details":"H100 + Xeon Platinum 8480C/CUDA12.5、L4 + AMD EPYC 7F52/CUDA12.4。Llama3.2 Vision、Gemma-2、Ministral、Jamba1.5、character.ai、PyramidKV等。","quality_effect":"model computationや重みを変更せずmemory allocation/cache reuseのみを変えるためmodel qualityへの近似誤差はない。","storage_targets":["異種layerのKV cache","vision embedding cache","speculative decodingのdraft/target KV"],"bottlenecks":["異なるembedding sizeによるpage内部断片化","sliding-window/self-attention混在時の不要KV保持","layer別dependency差によるprefix cache hit低下"],"evidence_locations":["§3","§4","§5","§6","§7.1-7.4"],"source":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.18292","sources":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2503.18292","https://arxiv.org/html/2503.18292"],"code":null,"implementation":"vLLM上に約4000行のPythonで実装し、CUDA kernel変更なし。vLLM v0.6.4の90 modelと互換と報告。著者固有repoは一次資料で確認できない。","last_checked":"2026-09-13","references":[],"references_checked_at":"2026-09-13","references_source":"arXiv HTML","references_total":0}
}

{
  "schema_version":1,
